1
00:00:00,059 --> 00:00:02,889
(Sheldon:)but you can trust him
with your life.

2
00:00:02,895 --> 00:00:06,265
(Sheldon:)And he does more things for you
than I can even begin to list.

3
00:00:06,265 --> 00:00:09,465
(Leonard:)Thank you.

4
00:00:09,468 --> 00:00:11,698
(Sheldon:)Oh, no, he's drinking it.

5
00:00:14,706 --> 00:00:15,936
(gunfire sounding on videogame)

6
00:00:15,941 --> 00:00:17,141
(Howard:)Look at this.

7
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:19,972
(Howard:)Trent is rebuilding
a vintage motorcycle.

8
00:00:19,978 --> 00:00:22,708
(Dave:)Hmm.
That is so cool!

9
00:00:22,714 --> 00:00:24,684
(Raj:)Old broken things
are so much better

10
00:00:24,683 --> 00:00:27,783
(Raj:)than new things that work.

11
00:00:27,786 --> 00:00:29,256
(Bernadette:)Who's Trent?

12
00:00:29,254 --> 00:00:30,484
(Howard:)Oh, he's our fan.

13
00:00:30,489 --> 00:00:32,589
(Bernadette:)Fan of what?
WOLOWITZ: Uh...

14
00:00:32,591 --> 00:00:36,091
(laughs): Did you forget?
We're in a band.

15
00:00:36,095 --> 00:00:38,825
(Bernadette:)You mean because you played one
time in the comic book store?

16
00:00:38,831 --> 00:00:42,771
(Howard:)And at the children's hospital
until they asked us to leave.

17
00:00:42,768 --> 00:00:44,238
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Hey,

18
00:00:44,236 --> 00:00:47,266
(Raj:)dude, Trent just checked in at
the coffee shop on Fair Oaks.

19
00:00:47,272 --> 00:00:50,242
(Howard:)Really? You want to go
down there and meet him?

20
00:00:50,242 --> 00:00:52,512
(Bernadette:)Are you stalking him?
That's creepy.

21
00:00:52,511 --> 00:00:53,881
(Raj:)It's not creepy.

22
00:00:53,879 --> 00:00:56,209
(Raj:)I built a Footprints on the Moon
fan page, Trent joined it.

23
00:00:56,215 --> 00:00:58,245
(Howard:)After that, all I did was
check out his profile,

24
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,750
(Howard:)go back in the archive
of his feed

